                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4a79af5e-f084-357a-a36d-67cba841df89",
                                        "entry_id": "b02f5f50-0b8c-3e69-888d-4854242566c1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Sideslip angle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5adf3d14-231d-3c79-8700-93f5b0318375",
                                        "entry_id": "b02f5f50-0b8c-3e69-888d-4854242566c1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The range of engine power settings in which the blade pitch angle of a constant-speed propeller is controlled directly by the angle of the engine's throttle lever (rather than varying with engine torque and airspeed to maintain a constant propeller RPM), allowing the propeller to be disked to generate high drag and slow the aircraft quickly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9dd20b43-1ffb-30f6-acb2-b9f097d0c1b5",
                                        "entry_id": "b02f5f50-0b8c-3e69-888d-4854242566c1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative spelling of betta (“fish in the genus Betta”)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative",
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fa215926-c7f0-368d-9034-bbb41b521c11",
                                        "entry_id": "b02f5f50-0b8c-3e69-888d-4854242566c1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Ellipsis of beta male, a man who is less competent or desirable than an alpha male."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "countable",
                                            "ellipsis",
                                            "slang",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "10d29d7f-6474-401d-8a75-8c3cb833df8b",
                                                "sense_id": "fa215926-c7f0-368d-9034-bbb41b521c11",
                                                "text": "“I guess in your psychological language of alpha males and beta males, I would be firmly in the camp that prefers the more laid-back betas,” she took a deep breath, “like your father.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9107041e-543f-4cd7-9ff4-da99cf2a51be",
                                                "sense_id": "fa215926-c7f0-368d-9034-bbb41b521c11",
                                                "text": "“They want sexy, virile alpha males, yes? But that doesn't come with sensitive and loyal and all of that. That's a beta. A frickin' collie, Lola. […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc3531fc-d3a5-43b3-82ed-478eec3b3de8",
                                                "sense_id": "fa215926-c7f0-368d-9034-bbb41b521c11",
                                                "text": "She'd always had a thing for alpha males. Not that she had any intention of being bossed around, even if one had her best interests at heart. Her fascination with alphas was that they were a challenge. Betas didn't hold much of an appeal."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d05f8181-438c-4352-88a6-4ad217473c70",
                                                "sense_id": "fa215926-c7f0-368d-9034-bbb41b521c11",
                                                "text": "When they ride the cock carousel in preference to the responsible betas that they find so boring, well, we guess that they pay."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6e513c94-6b10-45ee-9a34-53fee1d792b7",
                                                "sense_id": "fa215926-c7f0-368d-9034-bbb41b521c11",
                                                "text": "News of Harper-Mercer's murder spree, which killed ten, prompted speculation on neoreactionary forums that the long-awaited “beta uprising” of virginal shut-ins had begun. Not quite. But in Charlottesville, Virginia, in August 2017, a large audience of Americans finally saw the real beta uprising in the violent Nazi rally that shut the city down"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5c4f31c1-5f51-3a07-a179-5b092ab9ee4e",
                                        "entry_id": "b02f5f50-0b8c-3e69-888d-4854242566c1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In omegaverse fiction, a person of a secondary sex similar to normal humans, lacking the biological drives of alphas and omegas but generally capable of bonding and mating with either."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "slang",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fff0955d-5384-4c50-b9fa-52f44fd72c82",
                                                "sense_id": "5c4f31c1-5f51-3a07-a179-5b092ab9ee4e",
                                                "text": "Many A/B/O stories posit societies where biological imperatives divide people based on wolf pack hierarchies into sexual dominants (alphas), sexual submissives (omegas), and everyone else (betas)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "955805c9-6b5f-4287-9490-7dffabdc7ac3",
                                                "sense_id": "5c4f31c1-5f51-3a07-a179-5b092ab9ee4e",
                                                "text": "In ASD, the beta also functions as a contrast, as Yuri is assumed to be a beta before his first heat reveals his omega status."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e13e1f1-819c-43a3-a21f-854a8721a09a",
                                                "sense_id": "5c4f31c1-5f51-3a07-a179-5b092ab9ee4e",
                                                "text": "Betas are usually second in command to the reigning alpha, and omegas belong to the lowest caste of the social hierarchy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
